5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a structure that keeps the door open for newcomers without exposing everyone's private costs.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"Before we pick a model, we must ensure the administrative burden does not crush the next treasurer.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,The current system hides how uneven the actual participation is among those who pay the same.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,People are hesitating to commit to evenings; the fee structure is making belonging feel like a gamble.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Takumi,,I refuse to guess next year's costs. We need hard numbers on what we can actually count on.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Benjamin If the collection process is too heavy, the whole thing collapses.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,@Asuka Agreed. I need to see the time logs to understand the true cost of administration.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,@Takumi Guessing is dangerous. I want to see who is actually showing up versus who is just paying.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan If we make the cost per event visible, will people stop coming?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Takumi,,@Shunichi Visibility is better than uncertainty. I need to know the inflow reliability.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will look at the taster forms to see why people drift away.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I will check the treasurer's hours and the ledger to see where the money and time go.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will tally the sign-in sheets and compare them to the rota to see the workload split.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the winter social feedback and the weekday turnout to gauge the hesitation.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I will review the bank statements and the mid-year joiner records to assess cash flow.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,Let's see what the data says before we argue about principles.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,Logic over emotion. The numbers will tell us what is sustainable.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,The quiet ones are speaking up now. We need to hear them through the data.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"If the data shows fear, we adjust the structure to remove the friction.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"No more guessing. We fix this with facts, not feelings.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
