63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,Option B removes the friction. People can choose a level that fits their comfort. I support it.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Takumi,,Option B gives us predictable income. No more chasing payments. I vote for it.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
