69,3,2,talk,Takumi,,@Shunichi Exactly. We need stability. Option B provides that.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Asuka,,I am confident in Option B. It respects the club's culture and its practical needs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
