72,3,3,talk,Jonathan,,I am voting for Option B. It is the best of a difficult set of choices.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,I am voting for Option B. It restores a sense of belonging without the hesitation.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
